flowchart TD
 L[Legacy IBM/BeeAI ACP client] --> I[Inventory endpoint + schema + event contract]
 I --> A[Compatibility adapter]
 A --> G[Authenticated identity + tenant gateway]
 G --> D[Trusted A2A Agent Card resolver]
 D --> V{A2A 1.0.0 interface valid?}
 V -->|No| R[Reject or approved rollback]
 V -->|Yes| M[Translate legacy run to Message/Task]
 M --> K[Stable idempotency mapping]
 K --> T[A2A specialist task]
 T --> E[Status + artifact events]
 E --> N[Legacy event/response normalizer]
 N --> P[Parity + security evaluator]
 P --> C{Canary gates pass?}
 C -->|No| R
 C -->|Yes| U[Promote A2A traffic]
 U --> X[Retire legacy after consumer migration]
